# ── Secrets — never commit ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Broad on purpose: this repo is destined for a CCSM-owned GitHub remote, and a
# key that reaches a remote must be treated as compromised and rotated even if
# the commit is later removed. Patterns are unanchored so they match at any
# depth, not just the repo root.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
secrets.toml
**/secrets.toml
*.pem
*.key
service_account*.json
*-service-account*.json
credentials*.json
client_secret*.json
gcp_*.json
